OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy this morning with
OL,6,Fa chance of rain at times moving
OL,7,Feastwards. Rain clearing by very early
OL,8,Fafternoon bringing widespread very
OL,9,Fwarm sunshine to the region and an
OL,10,Fincreasingly humid feel. Winds light
OL,11,For moderate.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FFine and dry this evening. A
OL,14,Fmuggy night to come for most and many
OL,15,Fplaces staying dry overnight, however
OL,16,Fa few isolated spots of rain are
OL,17,Fpossible after midnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
